# With origin mode set, DSR 6 reports the cursor relative to the scrolling
# region's top margin. Reporting an absolute row puts a cursor handshake inside
# a region off by the margin.
size: 10x8
description: the cursor report is relative to the top margin under origin mode

--- input
\e[3;6r\e[?6h\e[1;1H\e[6n

--- expect-reply
\e[1;1R
